Error [E0224]: This call takes `holder.buf`, but `holder.buf` has no `^` mark
  --> receiver_mark_missing_take.jet:11:5
    |
 11 |     holder.buf.seal()
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The method is declared with `^self`, so the call takes the named place it is called on; the mark sits on that place, the same way `edit(&buf)` and `consume(^text)` mark arguments
 Fix: Write `^holder.buf`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0224
